    title: "What Is a Good Burn Multiple? Benchmarks by Stage, and Where the Bands Come From",
    excerpt: "A good burn multiple is under 1.5x for a company with real revenue, and 2–3x at seed. Here is the formula, the stage-by-stage bands, and the uncomfortable part: the bands everyone quotes were never measured, so here is how to read yours against your own stage.",
