    excerpt: "A 13-week cash flow model is the weekly liquidity forecast lenders, boards and turnaround advisers ask for. Here is the exact row-by-row layout to paste into a spreadsheet, the four inputs that decide whether it is right, and the mistakes that make one useless.",
