      "## What Is What-If Analysis?",
      "What-if analysis, also called scenario analysis, is the process of modeling different decisions and seeing their projected outcomes. Instead of committing to a plan and hoping for the best, you create multiple scenarios — each representing a different strategic choice — and compare their impact on your key metrics: runway, revenue, profitability, and survival probability.",
